### AstroOverz API Testing - REST Client
### Use this file with the REST Client extension in VS Code/Cursor

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiUrl = https://api.astrooverz.com
@date = 2025-01-15
@location = Chennai

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Panchangam API - Today's Panchangam
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/panchangam?date={{date}}&location={{location}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Panchangam API - Specific Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/panchangam?date=2025-01-15&location=Mumbai
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Panchangam API - Current Date (no date param)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/panchangam?location=Delhi
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Birth Chart API
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/birth-chart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "dob": "1990-01-15",
  "tob": "10:30",
  "location": "Chennai, India",
  "latitude": 13.0827,
  "longitude": 80.2707
}

